+# crew#620: every staged shell file under bin/, .githooks/, scripts/ -- shellcheck -S warning,
+# shfmt -d, `set -euo pipefail`, a trap. bin/idp-shell-strict itself filters non-shell paths out
+# (a stray *.py in $shell_staged is a no-op), and fails open when shellcheck/shfmt are missing
